   "text": "Any provider a definition names\n\nCalled by the Router (api role) and by Job\nhandlers (worker role)\n\nOnly on the definition's API hosts, with a\nsocket-time destination check and verified\nTLS\n\nSends OAuth callbacks, Job callbacks and\nevent deliveries back",
